# Protocol Architecture (High Level)

Copy for PDF export. Embedded copy in [06-architecture.md](../06-architecture.md).

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Users
        D[Depositors]
        W[Withdrawers]
    end

    subgraph VaultLayer["Vault Layer"]
        RV[RobinVault ERC-4626]
        ACC[RobinAccountant]
    end

    subgraph StrategyLayer["Strategy Layer"]
        CS[CoreStrategy]
        GS[GrowthStrategy]
    end

    subgraph Policy["Policy & Execution"]
        OR[OracleRegistry]
        RR[RewardRegistry]
        ER[ExecutionRouter]
        DEX[UniswapV2DexAdapter]
    end

    subgraph External["External"]
        IF[Index Finance]
        FEEDS[Price Feeds]
        POOL[DEX Pools]
    end

    subgraph Gov["Governance"]
        AM[AccessManager]
    end

    D -->|deposit INDEX| RV
    W -->|withdraw / redeemInKind| RV
    RV --> ACC
    RV <-->|report| CS
    RV <-->|report| GS
    CS --> IF
    GS --> IF
    CS --> ER
    GS --> ER
    ER --> DEX
    DEX --> POOL
    CS --> RR
    GS --> RR
    CS --> OR
    GS --> OR
    ER --> OR
    OR --> FEEDS
    AM -.->|restricted| RV
    AM -.->|restricted| CS
    AM -.->|restricted| GS
    AM -.->|restricted| OR
    AM -.->|restricted| RR
    AM -.->|restricted| ER
```
